# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Both are PUBLIC values baked into the app
# bundle (the EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix is what makes Metro inline them), the same
# pair the player web app ships as NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL and
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY. Never put a service role key here.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
